@startuml command-pipeline
title Command subsystem — text to actions
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

[command line\n'1 thru 4 + 7 at 50'] as txt
[Tokenizer\ntokens.txt] as tok
[CST\nParsing::Syntax::Node] as cst
[typed AST\nMacros::Program] as ast
[CommandExecutor\nCommandVisitor] as exec
[Engine facade] as eng

txt --> tok
tok --> cst
cst --> ast : AstBuilder
ast --> exec : accept/visit
exec --> eng

note bottom of cst
  grammar (commands.syn) and token defs
  (commands.txt) are external data files:
  the console language evolves without
  recompiling.
end note
@enduml
